// Title: Bitbucket Secret Scanning Rule Deleted
// ID: ff91e3f0-ad15-459f-9a85-1556390c138d
// Status: test
// Level: low
// Author: Muhammad Faisal (@faisalusuf)
// Date: 2024-02-25
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Detects when secret scanning rule is deleted for the project or repository.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((auditType.category EQUALS "Projects" OR auditType.category EQUALS "Repositories") AND (auditType.action EQUALS "Project secret scanning rule deleted" OR auditType.action EQUALS "Repository secret scanning rule deleted"))
